  "prefLabel": "Emp 407.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 407.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to allow eligible claimants to receive the maximum amount of unemployment compensation benefits to which they are entitled under the Unemployment Compensation Extension Act of 2010, H.R. 4213 effective July 22, 2010, and RSA 282-A:30, I.(d)(3)(C).\n\nSource. #9764 EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-30-10, EXPIRED: 1-26-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
}
